{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_jaksel_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_jaksel_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"无价的勋章","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_jaksel_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"b4e7ed7769be8b6638be8493f5a6450fba76c6afaeffa964d537bca2fd815871","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"杰克因在危机现场无畏的救人事迹而受到政府的表彰。却不曾想在表彰会现场，有记者当场指证，杰克的事迹是虚假编撰的。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“重大源石事故致多人死伤。”\n“谁是现场的神秘人？”\n“英雄警察。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好！麻烦看下这边可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对此事不做任何回应是代表了官方的态度吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要回避我们的镜头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在此之前是否对此事知情呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"事实已经摆在了这里，请正面回答！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"不久之前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，原来你在这里，我还一直在找你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰克干员，你是不是有点太兴奋了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起对不起，你没事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有受伤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，不过你自己倒是小心一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"作为即将接受表彰的救人英雄，可别在会议开始前弄伤自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你看你，衣服也弄得皱皱巴巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没事没事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看！这样就好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是又跑哪里去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，其实我刚刚偷偷去了一趟会场，看见好多人都在那边忙碌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我顺手就帮他们一起把设备搬到了台子上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你还帮忙一起干活去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊！真的是特别沉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且啊......那个时候我站在台子上，就突然想起以前父亲每次参加授勋仪式的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我坐在下面看着他，周围的人都在鼓掌，但我会比他们拍得都响！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以父亲肯定能找到我坐的位置，就算他一脸严肃，也会偷偷地对我微笑一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次是我要站在上面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜他在外执行任务，没有办法赶到现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那他也一定会为你感到骄傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后我要完完整整地讲给父亲听！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你跟我来一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"政府那边说，在会议开始前有一些事务必须和你本人确认一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"在那天如此紧急和危险的情况下，能够义无反顾地勇敢冲进现场并救出了那么多人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是令人钦佩，杰克警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，其实我以前只是辅警......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"没有关系，你的情况我们已经和罗德岛沟通过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"包括你的矿石病问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"在矿石病方面，罗德岛提供了相应的检测结果，没有错吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不会有错，罗德岛对自己干员的健康检测是绝对负责的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以为此担保。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，其实我个人是觉得，只要在身体表面没有明显的痕迹，这都不是太大问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"即便真的有人拿这件事做文章，我们也有相应的预案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"预案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻警官，休假外出偶遇突发险情，救人过程中不幸意外感染矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会这样对外解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果这样的话......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是最坏的一个可能性，当然我们不希望有任何的意外发生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎样，我们都认为你是我们哥伦比亚警察队伍里光荣的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你的父亲一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我还比不上我的父亲，他才是真正的警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那对你来说，这不是一次绝佳的机会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"向你父亲证明自己也可以成为像他一样的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"这份文件给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“请问你在冲进现场的那一刻，有想过自己的家人吗......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“听说你的父亲也是一名警察，所以他在事后是怎么评价你的行为的......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“请问你的身体恢复得如何，会影响之后的工作和生活吗......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的内容都要按照这个上面的说法去回答吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你有疑问，不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"以最好的形象出现在媒体公众面前，才不会让你父亲失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你说对不对，杰克警官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"对，杰克警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次的表彰，不仅会彰显政府与警队的光荣形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"也是你个人的荣誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"更是你父亲的荣耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我这就去收拾一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定会做好的，放心吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，在会议开始前我会安排你去见一下这次被救者的代表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"他非常感谢你能救他出来，说一定要在表彰会前见你一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......脸上应该没有脏东西了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，我需要提醒你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"政府那边实际上并没有向罗德岛提出正式将你重新聘回警队的要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"所以无论他刚刚怎么说，很有可能只是出于一些宣传上的需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我衣服怎么样？后面呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"都挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，你听到我说的了吗？你现在太紧张了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......可这的确会是我第一次站在台上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总觉得父亲一定会坐在台下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一我真的说错了话或者做错了什么怎么办！他肯定一眼就能发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可底下坐着那么多人，而我看不到他在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道父亲那时会是什么表情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会很失望吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我现在还配不上警官这个称呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以就算不能回到警队也没有关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那份文件给我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是想做到最好，就像父亲坐在那里一样！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你好？是杰克警官吗？工作人员告诉我你在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思打扰到你们，不过我想试试能不能在会议开始前，对你做一个简短的独家采访。可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哦对了，这是我的证件，我是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我们现在还有点事情要处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等下在会上，会有留给记者的提问时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"只会耽误你们一点点时间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚听到你们提到一份文件，是你们手上的吗？抱歉我不是有意偷听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我有一些重要的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，我们走吧，那个人还等着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下会在会上认真回答你的问题的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我给所有人都讲过我父亲的故事，他很厉害！无论是抓坏人还是救人，没有任何事情能难倒他。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（媒体上关于父亲的报道也是如此，他就是警队的模范！不过父亲却不喜欢我把关于他的报道和照片带在身边。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（那些父亲帮助过的人我大多都认识......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（他们总是会来拜访父亲，然后对我说，希望我成为和父亲一样的警察。这个时候父亲总是会说我还只是个辅警，还有很多东西要学。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（说起来，我也从来没有真正见到过他得到的那些奖章，不知道父亲为什么不带回家里。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（所以今天这枚奖章，应该会是我们家里面，摆放的第一枚奖章！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官！是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是你！我肯定不会认错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过你肯定认不出我来了！那天我们所有人都是熏了一脸的灰，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！原来是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那，那我帮你推轮椅吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，恢复得很好，你看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行！我来推你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，杰克警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，麻烦看一下这边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思市长先生，麻烦再重拍一张可以吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，麻烦那位警官和市长先生站近一点可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要拍一张合影，谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下！麻烦这位警官站直一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以把衣服整理一下吗？谢谢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官，请问那天你在冲进现场的一瞬间，有想到过自己的家人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现场的情况的危险程度，你肯定比我们所有人都要更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官，请问那个时候你犹豫过吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，杰克警官刚刚经历了这么大一场事故，也是作为新人第一次接受表彰，有些紧张也是可以理解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"大家一个问题一个问题地来，不要着急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，她的父亲也是一位优秀的警官，也曾站在这里接受过表彰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得那个时候他也和你一样，有些局促不安，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我虽然那个时候还小，但我记得很清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是很多年前了，父亲还是这里地方警局的一名普通警察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那次是他在执勤的时候......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"父亲......\n如果他此刻就坐在台下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得我做的事情，只是出于一名警察的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有时间，而且当时的情况......也不允许我有任何的犹豫，毕竟哪怕只是多拖延一分一秒，对于里面的被困者都是非常危险的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在冲进现场的那一瞬间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也的确想起过我的父亲，但更多是想到他对我的鼓励......和期许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这让我更加坚定，一定要把被困者救出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你提到了你的父亲，那请问他知道你所做的事情之后，是如何评价的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父亲作为警察，此刻依旧奋斗在岗位上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遗憾他不能亲自来到现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想，他一定会为我感到骄傲和自豪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以请问这是你加入警队的原因吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成为一名警察去帮助别人，去向你父亲证明自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是因为加入了警队才会去帮助其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我的父亲，他......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我想插一句话可以吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想说，无论是杰克警官，还是她的父亲，在我们的警察队伍里能有这样的精神传承和延续......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对于像我这样的普通民众来说，是非常有安全感的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也感谢市长先生今天能邀请我出席这样一个场合，让我能够当面向我的救命恩人表达感谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我的荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"同时我也希望这样的精神不仅是在警队内传承延续，更能引发所有的政府部门去学习。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"让我本人以及所有的政府人员，真正成为所有公民的仆人，所有公民的榜样以及所有公民的守护者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官，麻烦靠近一点拍一张合影可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警官，麻烦你笑一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰克警官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰克警官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰克警官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你在这儿后空翻也不会有人看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以本来就应该是这样的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲他也需要这样去做吗？按照他们的要求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，这只是一次宣传。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"他们给你额外强加的身份，他们让你回答的内容，都只是他们需要的宣传。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但是其实你并不需要这些去证明什么，罗德岛上的每一个人都知道你是一个热心善良的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"大家也知道你的父亲是毋庸置疑的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的......无法接受，你可以选择现在离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"后续的事情会由罗德岛来处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！我不会就这么离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在意的不是宣传或者这些荣誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我可以去做！真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那你在意的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“成为一名真正的警察，成为我的孩子和市民的榜样。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有我在台下听到的那些话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的......是这样想的吗？他真的是想对我说这些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你救了人，这是事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那无论他们怎么安排，这枚勋章都理应颁发给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我代表全体政府官员，警队的全体成员......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"还有全体获救者及其家属......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"向在此次事故搜救中表现突出的杰克警官，授予杰出英勇勋章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你继续努力，作为政府和警察的杰出代表，继续为本市市民做出贡献。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，市长先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我有话要问！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么人？！你的媒体邀请函呢？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"作为那天唯一冲进现场的当事人，你是否认识这张照片上的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个人，他们在现场已经遇难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我试着救过他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那你到底救出来了几个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在这张照片上面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定，当时情况太过混乱，我根本没有留意他们的长相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那这位代表，请问你认识照片上的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你不认识？！真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"通知警察，把这个非法闯入者抓起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这里不就有一位你们宣传的英雄警官吗，让她抓我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"然后又是大功一件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官，抓住他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你继续说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，我看你准备装到什么时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"媒体报道说，这次事故受到波及的是一家七口。而事故原因则是这家感染最深的二儿子，以及一些市长先生难以启齿的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然官方没有公布长相，但我还是搞到了这家人的照片，就是这张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你确认了两名遇害者，然后又救出来了四个人，再加上二儿子，的确正好七个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可你身边这位获救者居然认不出照片上自己的家人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我家里人没有出事！你为什么要逼问我这些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想要问什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人，刚刚经历了这么大的灾难和变故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底要做什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你身边的这个人是个被开除的警察，这是他之前的档案记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可是很奇怪，我居然没有找到杰克警官之前任何的警队记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没有投诉，没有表彰，没有加班？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么巧合出现了，现场那么多警察只有你冲了进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对了。你父亲是英雄啊，那如果英雄的女儿也是英雄呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"这么棒的宣传素材，哈哈哈！为了市长先生的选票和愈发糟糕的政府形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我承认你的父亲的确是一名优秀的警察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可你真的是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的，是警官吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对此事不做任何回应是代表了某种官方的态度吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要回避我们的镜头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无礼的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在此之前是否对此事知情呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，我已经发讯息让罗德岛调查这件事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你先不要说任何话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，请问他刚刚说的都是真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"所有你们听到的这些，都是无端指责！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"这是对我们的英雄的无端中伤与亵渎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"来人！把这个人抓住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官，你在做什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有事情要问他，你们不能带他走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都让开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你要问什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实话说，我也不知道今天到底发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是很开心能看到自己救的人安然无恙地出现在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但刚刚你说这个获救者是假的，这一切都是安排的演出？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚，那天的事故绝对不是伪造的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我救出来的人......那些在现场不幸遇难的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这绝不可能是假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以真正的获救者在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么会不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"关我什么事，我又怎么知道他们为什么不能出现在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是该问问安排了这一切的人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我什么也不知道，不要问我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，这一切到底是怎么回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经越界了，这不是你该管的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"请注意你的身份，你代表的是本市的警察，也代表了你的父亲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，请问您当时为什么会冲进去救人？面对那么多歹徒，您会害怕吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听说有人指责正是因为您的鲁莽行动，才导致了之后歹徒的残忍暴行以及对被害者的伤害，请问您作何回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听说您的孩子也是一名警察，请问如果是您被困在里面，您会希望她也采取和您一样的行动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其实我觉得这样的提问完全没有必要，甚至去报道这件事都完全没有必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是如果不得不做回应的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然我能做到的话，那就不能见死不救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不是警官，我的父亲才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你承认了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不配，代表我的父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是真正的英雄！不允许你们去质疑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，我只知道现在有四个人失踪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我救了他们，他们应该出现在这里，但是现在他们不见了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们到底在哪里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独立记者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救者代表","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我的问题，不然的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，是在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我查过了，那四名获救的人的确是在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他们都在那场事故里感染了矿石病，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以哪怕是在哥伦比亚，政府也不希望他们出现在公共场合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这场事故的起因对政府来说，也不是什么光彩的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"“年轻警官，休假外出偶遇突发险情，救人途中不幸意外感染矿石病。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么样，他们都能编造出合理的说辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过这一次，你恰好是最合适的素材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会没事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"在后续和当地政府的医疗合作中，我们会争取为他们安排治疗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然这次这么一闹，可能会有点困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是你的错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"实话说，刚刚被派驻到哥伦比亚的这个地方，然后就在这么危险的事故中，奋不顾身救出四个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士如果知道了，也一定会特别开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，杰克干员。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这枚奖章你还留着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我还要给父亲讲这个故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"avg_347_jaksel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
